help you find your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560310/extras/0d66362d1900e73ccdd5004ab3c554bd.poster.avif?t=1742468390\" width=750 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560310/extras/0d66362d1900e73ccdd5004ab3c554bd.mp4?t=1742468390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you get:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An uncanny experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles along your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very unexpected ending (no clickbait)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560310/extras/5d327f14e070db43c24e2cc3fde9ba7e.poster.avif?t=1742468390\" width=764 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560310/extras/5d327f14e070db43c24e2cc3fde9ba7e.webm?t=1742468390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560310/extras/5d327f14e070db43c24e2cc3fde9ba7e.mp4?t=1742468390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
